WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.208
I’ve assembled the greatest con men in the NFL

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.750
Do just well enough to get the money

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:06.375
then your talent disappears

00:00:06.375 --> 00:00:08.000
But Fitzy, you’ve stolen millions

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.208
from the Rams, Bengals, Bills, Titans, Texans, Jets

00:00:10.208 --> 00:00:11.125
What else is there?

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:13.916
I’m going to steal the starting QB job for the Bucs

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:17.458
Here’s the plan

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:19.416
I cause a distraction in the media

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:20.000
Ahem-

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.250
I went to Harvard

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:23.125
but I’m wearing silly clothes

00:00:23.125 --> 00:00:23.958
Wow! Look!

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:25.958
Next we need a QB controversy

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.750
That’s where Sammy Sleeves comes in

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:28.416
Whoops

00:00:28.416 --> 00:00:30.208
maybe you should start the rookie!

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:31.375
Dalton, Marvin

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:32.791
I need you to get people excited

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.666
but still lose a Wild Card game

00:00:34.916 --> 00:00:36.541
The AFC North is really up for grabs

00:00:36.541 --> 00:00:37.166
At this point

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:39.583
no one will know what it takes to be an NFL quarterback

00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:43.000
And if I play one good half, I’ll get the job

00:00:43.041 --> 00:00:45.000
Now eventually, I'll be exposed

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:45.625
Uh, sir

00:00:45.625 --> 00:00:46.625
you’re going to want to see this

00:00:46.625 --> 00:00:48.000
Only I get to be overpaid

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.458
Get him!

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:49.208
Tannehill

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.000
that’s when you confuse everybody

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:51.833
Uhhhhhhhh-

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:53.333
they are 3-0 uhhh

00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:54.875
And they’ll have to start me anyway

00:00:54.875 --> 00:00:55.791
Any questions?

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:57.833
Why don’t we just play great football all the time?

00:00:57.833 --> 00:01:00.000
Because that’s so hard

